    "Name": "Dragon Fire",
    "Details": "A 28th century design that first saw production in 3058, the Dragon Fire is a 75-ton mech designed for brawling. The DRG-3F is armed with a Gauss Rifle and an LB-10X, with a Large Laser and a pair of Medium Pulse Lasers as secondary weapons. A 300-rated XL Engine and an Endo Steel Skeleton provide the weight need for the heavy payload, while CASE and Guardian ECM add to the designs survivability. \n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.13</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
